# Todo 14 review and repair

Date: 2026-07-18

## Deliberate review failure

The first draft described changing `## Rule` to `## Rul` as
`extract/invalid-markdown-structure`.

That ID was wrong. The Markdown finding inventory at
`src/extract/markdown-body.ts:72-93` defines `headingFinding()` and returns
`extract/unrecognized-heading` for an unrecognized heading. Its message also
offers a close heading when the edit distance is two or less.

## Repair

The README now identifies `extract/unrecognized-heading` for the `## Rul`
experiment and states that `Rule` is suggested. The refusal example is
therefore Markdown-specific and matches the current reifier finding ID.
